("Do I put the tab on top of the clothes or under?", "Under: tab in the drum first, clothes on top."),
("How do I use laundry detergent tabs?", "Drop a tab in the empty drum, add clothes, wash. [Use tabs in any washer](/blogs/how-to/how-to-use-laundry-detergent-tabs-in-any-washer/)."),
("Can I break a tab in half?", "We don't recommend it. Tabs are pressed to be one dose. Use one tab for small or regular loads."),
